  "description": "A modern, ergonomic dependency injection container for .NET 8+. Rokstep.Ninject is\n      NOT a drop-in replacement for the deprecated Ninject library — it uses a fresh,\n      fluent API designed around record types, nullable reference types, IAsyncDisposable,\n      and a stable surface that positions later releases for expression-tree / source-generator\n      optimization without breaking callers. For a drop-in replacement of the original\n      Ninject API, use the companion package Rokstep.Ninject.Shims.",
